From 42d6521a47dcfb952e7fe4da1353f750570157ab Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: t <tristan75015@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 14:22:18 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] TFEL: device code support in mathematical and material
 headers

- TFEL_DEVICE_CODE macro, defined when device code is compiled (CUDA,
  HIP, SYCL).
- BoundsCheck: functions callable in device code, returning a boolean
  (false if a strict bound is violated in device code, exceptions are
  thrown on the host as before). Names passed as C strings: building a
  std::string_view from a C string silently removes device code with nvcc.
- Host/device annotations: virtual destructor of MechanicalBehaviour,
  fixed size algorithms, eigen solvers of symmetric tensors (TFEL, FSES,
  GTE, Harari), decomposition in positive and negative parts, Hosford
  criterion.
- FSES: std::fpclassify replaced by tfel::math::ieee754::fpclassify,
  std::fpclassify silently removes device code with nvcc.
